### 2. Frontend InlineQueryResult Component

**File:** `/Users/cyyeh/Desktop/duckdb-data-agent/frontend/src/components/InlineQueryResult.tsx`

The `InlineQueryResult` component renders a `ToolCallResult` object with the following structure:

```typescript
interface ToolCallResult {
  toolCallId: string;
  toolName?: string;
  sql: string;
  command?: string;
  toolInput?: Record<string, unknown>;
  columns: string[];
  rows: Record<string, unknown>[];
