**Key rendering logic (Lines 79-187):**

1. **Chart rendering** (lines 88-108):
   - If `result.chart_spec` exists, renders either VegaLiteChartWidget or ChartWidget based on `chart_spec.library`
   - Shows chart title from Vega-Lite `spec.title` or Plotly `layout.title`
