```
BACKEND (agent.py)
  ├─ During streaming:
  │  ├─ thinking_delta → seg_thinking_buf
  │  ├─ text_delta → seg_answer_buf or assistant_text_parts
  │  ├─ content_block_start (thinking) → has_thinking = True
  │  ├─ content_block_start (text) → flush thinking to persisted_segments
  │  ├─ tool_use block → append tool segment (toolCallId, toolName, sql)
  │  ├─ tool_result block → UPDATE tool segment (columns, rows, error, output, chart_spec)
  │  ├─ subagent (Task) → replace tool segment with subagent_start
  │  ├─ subagent completion → append subagent_end (with text, sqlResults)
  │  └─ user_question → append user_question (with questionData)
  │
  └─ In finally block:
     ├─ Flush remaining thinking_buf
     ├─ Finalize answer segment
     ├─ Build metadata dict with segments
     └─ Call memory_store.add_message(conversation_id, "assistant", content, metadata=meta)

DATABASE (memory_store.py)
  ├─ Store messages table with:
  │  ├─ id (UUID)
  │  ├─ conversation_id (FK)
  │  ├─ role ("assistant")
  │  ├─ content (full text)
  │  └─ metadata (JSON string with segments array)
