  └─ Backend retrieves via memory_store.get_conversation(id)

FRONTEND (buildChatMessages.ts)
  ├─ Fetch GET /api/conversations/{id}
  ├─ Parse each message.metadata (JSON string)
  ├─ Map each segment to ContentSegment
  │  ├─ Extract toolResult (toolCallId, toolName, sql, columns, rows, error, output, chart_spec)
  │  ├─ Extract subagent data (subagentId, subagentName)
  │  ├─ Extract user question data
  │  └─ Map all fields with defaults
  ├─ Create ChatMessage with segments array
